  dialogue:
    NPCName: 
    sentences:
    - Hey.
    - How are you?
    - /(What should I say?)1
    - (He won't care, I shouldn't bother him..)
    - /(I'll try and think of something different to say)~
    - I'm doing fine.
    - Are you going to do something today?
    - /(What should I say?)2
    - "(He'd think even less of me if I did nothing \nagain today...)"
    - "/(I'll try and think of something different to \nsay)~"
    - I'm free to do anything.
    - "Good, you can take this washing down for \nonce."
    - "/(I really should take this to the laundry \nroom downstairs)-"
    names:
    - Roommate
    - Roommate
    - Me
    - Me
    - Me
    - Me
    - Roommate
    - Me
